  "iPhone/iPad 05-remote: Debug build Remote tab with the synthetic WatchFixture 'busy' snapshot; iPhone 16 Pro Max capture scaled uniformly to the 6.5-inch 1284x2778 set and composed with per-locale captions (scripts/compose-appstore-screenshots.py).",
